! ** Dialog Box: MAILING LISTS *******************************************

*lBoxRegisterTitle.labelString:		Mailing Lists
*lBRegisterAdress.labelString:		mailto: majordomo@axene.org
*BoxRegistration*Ok.labelString: 	Send Mail
*rbRegisterAnnounces.labelString: 	Subscribe to "axene-announce"
*rbRegisterBugs.labelString:		Subscribe to "xallwrite-bugs"
*rbRegisterUsers.labelString:		Subscribe to "axene-users"
*lRegisterReply.labelString:		Your Email address
*lMailCommand.labelString:		Mail command
*mailingListMsg: \n\
    Axene puts at your disposal some mailing lists which \
allow you to receive information by electronic mail.\n\
\n\
    "axene-announce" allows you to receive official announces \
of new products or new versions.\n\
\n\
    "xallwrite-bugs" informs you about corrections \
made in XAllWrite. Each Axene's product has its own \
mailing list that you can subscribe in our other \
products.\n\
\n\
    "axene-users" allows you to discuss with some other users of \
Axene's products. It's a moderated mailing list (each sended \
message is ratified by us) in order to avoid you a clutter \
of useless messages.\n
\n\
For each subscription to one of these mailing lists, you will \
receive an acknowledge by Email with necessary instructions \
on how to unsubscribe.\n






*fBRRegistered.labelString:		Subscribe to...
*fBRegisterCommand.labelString:		Mail command


